Mesas & cadeiras\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 260px; object-fit: cover;\" />\n        <div style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #132a34; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Mesas & cadeiras</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: #607078; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Encontros à mesa com conforto, leveza e acabamento sofisticado.</p>\n          <a href=\"https://wa.me/5541997682816?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20conhecer%20as%20op%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20de%20Mesas%20e%20cadeiras.\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #07516f; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Ver op&ccedil;&otilde;es no WhatsApp &#x2197;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background-color: #faf8f4; border: 1px solid #ebe7df; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/living-green.webp\" alt=\"Poltronas artesanais\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 260px; object-fit: cover;\" />\n        <div style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #132a34; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Poltronas artesanais</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: #607078; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Peças marcantes que combinam ergonomia, personalidade e tramas exclusivas.</p>\n          <a href=\"https://wa.me/5541997682816?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20conhecer%20as%20op%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20de%20Poltronas%20artesanais.\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #07516f; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Ver op&ccedil;&otilde;es no WhatsApp &#x2197;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background-color: #faf8f4; border: 1px solid #ebe7df; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/hanging-chair.webp\" alt=\"Balanços suspensos\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 260px; object-fit: cover;\" />\n        <div style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #132a34; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Balanços suspensos</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: #607078; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Um convite para desacelerar em espaços internos ou externos.</p>\n          <a href=\"https://wa.me/5541997682816?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20conhecer%20as%20op%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20de%20Balan%C3%A7os%20suspensos.\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #07516f; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Ver op&ccedil;&otilde;es no WhatsApp &#x2197;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background-color: #faf8f4; border: 1px solid #ebe7df; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/gourmet-black.webp\" alt=\"Banquetas gourmet\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 260px; object-fit: cover;\" />\n        <div style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #132a34; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Banquetas gourmet</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: #607078; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Design contemporâneo para bancadas, cozinhas e espaços gourmet.</p>\n          <a href=\"https://wa.me/5541997682816?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20conhecer%20as%20op%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20de%20Banquetas%20gourmet.\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #07516f; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Ver op&ccedil;&otilde;es no WhatsApp &#x2197;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background-color: #faf8f4; border: 1px solid #ebe7df; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-02