ect-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/gourmet-black.webp\" alt=\"Área gourmet contemporânea\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/daybed.webp\" alt=\"Daybed para desacelerar\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/hanging-chair.webp\" alt=\"Balanço para momentos de pausa\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/living-olive.webp\" alt=\"Living artesanal em verde oliva\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/armchairs-natural.webp\" alt=\"Poltronas clássicas renovadas\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n      <img src=\"https://ellegance-moveis.daring-fairy-0251.chatgpt.site/client-real/chair-olive.webp\" alt=\"Trama e cor sob medida\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px;\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
